{"id": "c21ad4e4-7f7d-4bee-81d7-5efa84de3515", "slug": "nexa-v3-intelligent-systems", "title": "NEXA v3 - Intelligent Systems", "description": "Nexa Intelligent UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"NEXA v3 - Intelligent Systems\"\ndescription: \"Nexa Intelligent UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FF5500\"\n  secondary: \"#030303\"\n  accent: \"#FF661A\"\n  background: \"#030303\"\n  surface: \"#E5E5E5\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# NEXA v3 - Intelligent Systems\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 10; favorites: 3; remixes: 1.\nTags: dashboard, charts, bento, animated, webgl, threejs, navigation, links.\n## Overview\nNexa Intelligent UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nNEXA v3 SYSTEM CORES DATA STREAMS ECOSYSTEM INITIALIZE V3 ENTERPRISE READY | Q4 RELEASE Intelligent systems built for absolute certainty We architect Neural Networks leveraging your distinct data sets, implementing cust…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Intelligent systems built for absolute certainty.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF5500, secondary #030303, accent #FF661A, background #030303, surface #E5E5E5, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>NEXA v3 - Intelligent Systems</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#030303] text-white font-sans overflow-x-hidden antialiased selection:bg-[#FF5500] selection:text-black\">\n\n    <!-- Background Grid -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-40\"\n         style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 60px 60px; mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at top, black 20%, transparent 80%); -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at top, black 20%, transparent 80%);\">\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- WebGL Container (Left Side Remix) -->\n    <div id=\"webgl-container\" class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full md:w-[60%] h-full z-0 pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen opacity-80 md:opacity-100\" style=\"mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, black 40%, transparent 100%); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, black 40%, transparent 100%);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <header class=\"fixed top-0 w-full z-50 border-b border-white/5 bg-[#030303]/80 backdrop-blur-md\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 h-20 flex items-center justify-between\">\n            <!-- Logo -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <span class=\"text-[#FF5500] font-medium tracking-wide text-lg\">NEXA <span class=\"text-white/40 text-xs\">v3</span></span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Nav -->\n            <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-10 font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-white/60\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">SYSTEM CORES</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">DATA STREAMS</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">ECOSYSTEM</a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- CTA -->\n            <button class=\"bg-[#e5e5e5] hover:bg-white text-black font-mono text-xs tracking-widest px-6 py-2.5 rounded-sm transition-all duration-300 font-medium\">\n                INITIALIZE\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Main Hero Section (Right Aligned Remix) -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 pt-32 pb-24 min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 relative flex justify-end\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-2xl relative pt-10 md:pt-0\">\n\n                <!-- Badge -->\n                <div class=\"gsap-fade-in flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-white/50 mb-10 opacity-0 uppercase\">\n                    <span class=\"bg-[#FF5500] text-black px-1.5 py-0.5 font-medium rounded-sm\">V3</span>\n                    <span>ENTERPRISE READY</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-white/20\">|</span>\n                    <span>Q4 RELEASE</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Headline (Masked Reveal) -->\n                <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl leading-none tracking-tight font-thin mb-8 text-white/95\">\n                    <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-2\"><span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-full\">Intelligent</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-2\"><span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-full\">systems</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-2\">\n                        <span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-full\">built</span>\n                        <span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-full\">for</span>\n                        <span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-full\">absolute</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-full text-[#FF5500] font-light\">certainty</span></div>\n                </h1>\n\n                <!-- Subheadline -->\n                <p class=\"gsap-fade-in text-lg md:text-xl text-white/50 font-thin leading-relaxed max-w-xl mb-12 opacity-0\">\n                    We architect Neural Networks leveraging your distinct data sets, implementing customized AI agents to autonomously manage intricate customer interactions with zero friction.\n                </p>\n\n                <!-- Actions -->\n                <div class=\"gsap-fade-in flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-8 mb-24 opacity-0\">\n\n                    <!-- Primary Button with Border Gradient -->\n                    <div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,85,0,0.8) 0%, rgba(255,85,0,0.1) 100%); padding: 1px; border-radius: 4px; box-shadow: 0 0 40px -10px rgba(255,85,0,0.3);\">\n                        <button class=\"bg-[#FF5500] hover:bg-[#ff661a] text-black font-mono text-xs tracking-widest px-8 py-4 rounded-sm w-full sm:w-auto transition-all duration-300 font-medium flex items-center gap-2 group\">\n                            INITIALIZE SYSTEM\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"16\" class=\"transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Secondary Link -->\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-white/60 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 flex items-center gap-2 group uppercase\">\n                        View Documentation\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"16\" class=\"transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Stats Grid -->\n                <div class=\"gsap-fade-in grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 md:gap-12 border-t border-white/10 pt-10 opacity-0 relative\">\n                    <!-- Subtle gradient overlay on border -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-[-1px] left-0 w-1/3 h-[1px]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #FF5500, transparent);\"></div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-thin tracking-tight mb-2 text-white/90\">94%</div>\n                        <div class=\"font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-white/40 uppercase\">Autonomy Rate</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-thin tracking-tight mb-2 text-white/90\">0.02%</div>\n                        <div class=\"font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-white/40 uppercase\">Deviation</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-1\">\n                        <div class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-thin tracking-tight mb-2 text-white/90\">72 hrs</div>\n                        <div class=\"font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-white/40 uppercase\">Deployment</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Footer Logos -->\n    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 w-full border-t border-white/5 bg-[#030303]/90 backdrop-blur-xl z-20 py-5\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 md:gap-0\">\n            <span class=\"font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-white/30 uppercase\">Ecosystem Partners</span>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 md:gap-16 opacity-50 grayscale flex-wrap justify-center\">\n                <!-- Text placeholders mimicking logos -->\n                <span class=\"font-sans font-medium text-sm tracking-widest\">SALESFORCE</span>\n                <span class=\"font-serif italic text-sm tracking-wide\">Zendesk</span>\n                <span class=\"font-mono font-medium text-sm tracking-tight\">DATADOG</span>\n                <span class=\"font-sans font-thin text-sm tracking-widest\">SNOWFLAKE</span>\n                <span class=\"font-sans font-medium text-sm tracking-tighter\">AWS</span>\n            </div>\n            <!-- Empty div for flex spacing balance on desktop -->\n            <div class=\"hidden md:block w-32\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Scripts for Animations & WebGL -->\n    <script>\n        // GSAP Animations\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // Masked Word Reveal\n            gsap.to(\".gsap-reveal\", {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n\n            // Fade in other elements - Fixed disappearing bug by removing clearProps: \"all\"\n            gsap.to(\".gsap-fade-in\", {\n                opacity: 1,\n                y: 0,\n                duration: 1,\n                stagger: 0.2,\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n                delay: 0.8\n            });\n        });\n\n        // Three.js WebGL Background (Abstract AI Core)\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const container = document.getElementById('webgl-container');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n            // Camera setup to align with left side (Remixed layout)\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            camera.position.z = 5;\n            camera.position.x = -1.5; // Shift left for remixed layout\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(window.devicePixelRatio);\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            // Create abstract geometry (Icosahedron)\n            const geometry = new THREE.IcosahedronGeometry(2, 2);\n\n            // Materials\n            const wireframeMaterial = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({\n                color: 0xFF5500,\n                wireframe: true,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.15\n            });\n\n            const pointsMaterial = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                color: 0xFF8844,\n                size: 0.03,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.8\n            });\n\n            const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, wireframeMaterial);\n            const points = new THREE.Points(geometry, pointsMaterial);\n\n            const coreGroup = new THREE.Group();\n            coreGroup.add(mesh);\n            coreGroup.add(points);\n\n            // Rotate the core slightly for perspective\n            coreGroup.rotation.x = Math.PI / 4;\n            coreGroup.position.y = 0.5;\n\n            scene.add(coreGroup);\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n                // Complex slow rotation\n                coreGroup.rotation.y -= 0.002; // Reversed rotation for remix\n                coreGroup.rotation.z += 0.001;\n\n                // Subtle pulsing effect on points\n                const time = Date.now() * 0.001;\n                pointsMaterial.size = 0.03 + Math.sin(time * 2) * 0.01;\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n\n            animate();\n\n            // Handle Resize\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                if(container) {\n                    camera.aspect = container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight;\n                    camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                    renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n                }\n            });\n        };\n\n        // Initialize WebGL after load\n        window.onload = initWebGL;\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nexa-v3-intelligent-systems.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nexa-v3-intelligent-systems.jpg", "source_name": "nexa-v3-intelligent-systems-DESIGN.md", "views": 85, "forks": 8, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T01:19:17.790801+00:00"}